<script setup lang="ts">import type { AnalyticsProfile } from "~/types/analytics"; defineProps<{profile:AnalyticsProfile;mutating:boolean}>(); const emit=defineEmits<{archive:[];restore:[]}>(); const copied=ref(false); async function copy(){if(import.meta.client){await navigator.clipboard?.writeText(location.href);copied.value=true;setTimeout(()=>copied.value=false,1500)}}</script>
<template><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 rounded-lg border bg-card p-3"><NuxtLink v-if="profile.data.actions.canEdit" :to="profile.data.actions.editPath" class="rounded-md border px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold">Ubah Data Lapangan</NuxtLink><button v-if="profile.data.actions.canArchive" type="button" class="rounded-md border border-amber-400 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold" :disabled="mutating" @click="emit('archive')">{{ mutating ? 'Memproses…' : 'Arsipkan' }}</button><button v-if="profile.data.actions.canRestore" type="button" class="rounded-md border border-emerald-500 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold" :disabled="mutating" @click="emit('restore')">{{ mutating ? 'Memproses…' : 'Pulihkan' }}</button><button type="button" class="rounded-md border px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold" @click="copy">{{ copied ? 'Tautan disalin' : 'Salin tautan internal' }}</button><NuxtLink to="/dashboard/analitik" class="rounded-md border px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold">Kembali ke Analitik</NuxtLink></div></template>
